ss=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">v1.52.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">March 15th, 2024</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>The <b>Reinforced Axe</b>, available exclusively at <b><a href=\"/wiki/The_Oak_Depot\" title=\"The Oak Depot\">The Oak Depot</a></b>, commands a price tag of <span style=\"color:#1dab6f;\">$44,000</span>. It is renowned as the best purchasable axe in the game.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appearance\">Appearance</span></h2>\n<p>Refined from the finest materials, the Reinforced Axe stands tall, crafted from <a href=\"/wiki/Blacksteel\" title=\"Blacksteel\">Blacksteel</a>—a material yet to be introduced—and <a href=\"/wiki/Adurite\" title=\"Adurite\">Adurite</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>The Reinforced Axe, alongside its companions in the reinforced tool set, was introduced as part of the highly anticipated <b>Progression Update</b></li>\n<li>When initially introduced, its original price was an exorbitant <span style=\"color:#1dab6f;\">$266,000</span></li>\n<li>When initially introduced, it delivered 0.625 damage</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903001939\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.039 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.050 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 79/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 65/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: